  <spirit:description>This is a UART controller module. its main purpsoe is to read the data from  Axis fifo and sequence the data in form of a frame and provides a CHK test.  The controller Burst the data to an axis serilizer as the word is 16 bits not 8.  then the serilizer sends the data to the UART IP. all using axis protocol.</spirit:description>
